                   A Short Introduction to Volkswriter 3



This document will introduce you to some of the highlights of Volkswriter 3:
spelling verification, automatic hyphenation, document layout capabilities,
math, and sorting.  Most of these examples are drawn from the tutorials,
where you will find more detailed instructions.


                                  SPELLING

The Volkswriter 3 spelling program is the most powerful on the market today.
Not only does it have the largest dictionary (170,000 words), it's also the
fastest and - as you'll soon see - the easiest to use.

You can use Volkswriter's powerful spelling program at any time while you
are writing or editing.  F2 is the spelling key.  To use it:

..LAYOUT 4  
   Press F2 once to check the spelling of a single word,

   Press F2 twice to check the spelling of a section of text or your entire
     document.

   Or you can mark a block with the F5 and F6 block markers, and then check
     spelling of the block by pressing F2 once.

..LAYOUT 1  

