                                  LAYOUTS


The powerful layout features of Volkswriter 3 make it easy for you to give
your documents exactly the look you want.  You can now change tab and margin
settings, use permanent indents and outdents, change line spacing and char
acter width - anywhere in your document.  All layout specifications are
automatically stored with your document, so you do not have to remember to
save them.  You can have up to 15 different layouts in one document, and
change from one to another by simply indicating which one you want.

You can see the effect of using different layouts in this document.

