                               MATH FUNCTIONS


A great deal of business writing requires mathematical calculations - bud
gets, expense reports, sales forecasts, and so on.  Volkswriter 3's math
features let you make the necessary calculations in your document, right
where they are needed, without a spreadsheet or other separate software.
Volkswriter 3 can add, subtract, multiply, divide, compute percentages and
subtotals, and use constants, on one or more rows or columns.  It can even
do crossfooting, adding down columns and across rows simultaneously.

Try Volkswriter's math functions with the examples that follow.  All math
procedures involve a few simple steps:  use Ctrl-F5 and Ctrl-F6 to mark the
column(s) or row(s), including operators.  Then press Ctrl-F9 and select the
math function.



