                                  SORTING


Volkswriter 3's sorting function can be used anywhere in a document.  Or it
can be used to sort a mailing list (such as those used with TextMerge), as
long as the "fields" are lined up in columns.

Let's try sorting a short list of names and telephone numbers with Volks
writer 3.  Sorting affects whole lines, so you can mark one part ("field")
within a line, and the lines will be sorted in order.

