   =>  Mark the last names below as a column.  To do this, place the cursor
       under the "W" of "Watson" in the first line, and press Ctrl-F5.  Then
       place the cursor at least two spaces after the "n" of Samson in the
       last line, so all last names will be within the block.  Press
       Ctrl-F6.  Then press Ctrl-F9, and select A - Ascending sort.


